ed execution IR support for `AnisotropicMedium`."},{"path":"tests/test_materials.py","description":"Coverage for anisotropic models, conversion policy, coefficient compilation, IR lowering, runtime rejection behavior, and anisotropic kernel updates."},{"path":"src/autofdtd/examples/materials.py","description":"New anisotropic material compilation example."},{"path":"phase1/working-memory.md","description":"Recorded the anisotropic-material decisions and handoff notes for later subpixel work."}],"error_summary":"","follow_up_notes":"Direct `Medium2D` simulation support and full dense-tensor `FullyAnisotropicMedium` runtime support remain intentionally deferred. The new diagonal anisotropic path is now available for later subpixel materialization work.","next_action":"none"}
