{"task_id":"task-018","status":"completed","summary":"Implemented explicit Phase 1 policy surfaces for advanced material families so lossy-metal, perturbation, and custom media are mapped, exported, validated, and rejected or deferred with clear guidance instead of surfacing as unknown types.","key_findings":["Added parseable policy models in `src/autofdtd/materials/advanced.py` for `LossyMetalMedium`, `PerturbationMedium`, `PerturbationPoleResidue`, `CustomMedium`, `CustomAnisotropicMedium`, and a generic `Custom*` reject bucket.","Extended material exports and planning metadata so deferred and rejected advanced-media families are part of the public API and feature matrix.","Validation now maps unknown `Custom*` medium tags into the explicit custom-media reject bucket, avoiding ambiguous unknown-feature failures for sampled custom material families.","Runtime compilation now fails explicitly for lossy-metal, perturbation, and custom media with actionable guidance such as `to_medium_approximation()` and `base_medium()` fallbacks where appropriate.","Added tests covering parsing, policy strings, validation behavior, runtime rejection paths, and fallback handling for `CustomPoleResidue`; `PYTHONPATH=src python -m pytest tests -q` passed with `100 passed`."],"artifacts":[{"path":"src/autofdtd/materials/advanced.py","description":"New advanced-material policy models and fallback helpers for deferred and rejected Phase 1 media."},{"path":"src/autofdtd/core/validation.py","description":"Validation updates for advanced-media tags, including the generic `Custom*` reject-bucket mapping."},{"path":"src/autofdtd/compiler/materials.py","description":"Explicit runtime rejection paths for lossy-metal, perturbation, and custom media families."},{"path":"src/autofdtd/materials/__init__.py","description":"Material registry and exports updated to include advanced-material policy surfaces."},{"path":"tests/test_materials.py","description":"Coverage for advanced-material parsing, policy behavior, validation, and runtime error paths."},{"path":"phase1/feature-checklist.md","description":"Phase 1 material checklist updated to reflect explicit perturbation and custom-media handling."},{"path":"phase1/working-memory.md","description":"Persistent task handoff notes updated with advanced-material policy decisions."},{"path":"README.md","description":"Top-level package notes updated to describe the new advanced-material policy surfaces."}],"error_summary":"","follow_up_notes":"Verification used `PYTHONPATH=src python -m pytest tests/test_materials.py -q`, `PYTHONPATH=src python -m pytest tests -q`, and `python -m compileall src`. The worktree already contained unrelated modifications from earlier tasks; they were left intact.","next_action":"none"}
