 ## Current Limits
 
 - Runtime compilation currently supports `Periodic`, `BlochBoundary`,
-  `PECBoundary`, `PMCBoundary`, `PML`, `StablePML`, `Absorber`, `Boundary`, and
-  `BoundarySpec`.
