tes."},{"path":"/workspace/autofdtd/src/autofdtd/ir/models.py","description":"Typed boundary IR classes and lowering helpers."},{"path":"/workspace/autofdtd/tests/test_boundaries.py","description":"Focused tests for boundary normalization, IR lowering, compiler/runtime behavior, and explicit unsupported-boundary errors."},{"path":"/workspace/autofdtd/docs/boundaries.md","description":"Boundary scope documentation for the implemented Phase 1 subset."},{"path":"/workspace/autofdtd/phase1/runs/task-019-attempt-001/result.json","description":"Structured task result matching the Phase 1 output schema."}],"error_summary":"","follow_up_notes":"The supported runtime subset is intentionally narrow for this task. `task-020` and later boundary tasks should extend the compiled boundary metadata and ghost-update stage instead of redesigning the public boundary containers.","next_action":"none"}
