phase1/logs/console.log:322356:- `ModeABCBoundary`, `BroadbandModeABCSpec`, and `BroadbandModeABCFitterParam` are now mapped compatibility surfaces, but Simulation validation and runtime compilation fail clearly because mode-solver dependencies are not available in Phase 1.
